  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Crisis Leadership Program, Syria</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aimed to strengthen the capacity of Syrian civil society leaders through adapted Crisis Leadership Program (CLP) training and mentorship, supporting more inclusive participation in humanitarian coordination and social cohesion. The project also examined local humanitarian networks, resource flows and power dynamics to inform more equitable partnerships and locally led response.</narrative>
  </description>
